    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you say you cant give advice but i really just want to know if it's actually a big deal. like, is it actually going to make the pill stop working or is that just a rare thing? im not trying to cook up a whole doctor visit, just wondering if i can just try a small dose for a bit to see if it helps.",
